    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jan 2024 12:25:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>玄冰：大学英文系老师，资深“张迷”，文学爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：JJ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 张爱玲的母语创作的天赋和成就胜过英文创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 张爱玲的小众英文书单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 左派丈夫赖雅的文艺影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 从张爱玲“自传三部曲”看少数族裔的创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 残稿《少帅》的遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a> 《粉泪》在美国文坛的冷遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">47:50</a> 张爱玲的英文创作内核仍然是中国古典的审美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3436">57:16</a> 非华裔的移民创作和“归化”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">1:09</a> 《易经》英文选段朗读</span></p>]]></description>
