    <guid isPermaLink="false">6516bb6819dde7bf6ac9e503</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Sep 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bunny：澳洲国立大学莎士比亚研究博士在读，文学媒体人</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：八妮爱读书</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：八妮Bunny，视频号：听Bunny讲英国文学</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：JJ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;莎士比亚的历史剧与真实历史的互文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;莎士比亚的语言和英语的历史环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> &nbsp;“油腻大叔”莎士比亚的“开黄腔”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;文艺复兴时期被塑造的“女性形象”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;莎士比亚和十四行诗的创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;英语口音的“鄙视链”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;现代人对经典阅读的误解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;莎剧版本的推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> &nbsp;莎士比亚的译本选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">44:35</a> &nbsp;八妮老师的莎士比亚课程介绍</span></p>]]></description>
